url: "https://vibeprevisbench.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vibeprevisbench/vibeprevisbench"
type: software
abstract: >-
  VibePrevisBench is a benchmark for 4D scene reconstruction with coding agents: an agent turns a brief into an
  executable 4D scene in Blender and renders its proxy video. Its 242 tasks span scripts, photos, continuations
  and reference videos. Rule-based Scene Check compares the exported 4D scene with hidden ground truth facts in
  nine dimensions; VLM-based Screen Check asks a VLM judge whether the facts that pass can be recognized in the
  proxy video.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - coding agents
  - Blender
  - 4D scene reconstruction
  - previsualization
